Steps to disable GPG when committing a text
 NB:every pproject folder contais a hidden folder called .git. inside the folder is a file name config that controlS Git for that project. 
Go to file explorer(Your standard windows folder browser)
go to your project folder(where your code files are located
at the top menu of file explorer, click view or look for the three dots ... depending on your windows version
hover show and make sure Hidden items has a checkmark next to it.
you should see a semi-transparent folder name .git appear in your project folder
Double -click to open that newly  revealed .git folder
Look for a file simply named config(no extension like .txt)
right-click on config, choose Open with and select Notepad.
Turn off GPG signing inside that fiel
scroll to the very bottom of the file , add a new line,
[commit]
     gpgsign = false
click file= save


